    8. im quantization: cim double centroid → uint16 — half-quantum (1.07e-5) shifts → IM gate flips at the 0.01 boundary, sort order ties. NOT fixable without keeping more precision.
    9. rt for OpenMS path: centroid RT vs apex-frame RT — changes pc.rt, spectrum RT, gates, canonical sort. NOT fixable by representation (centroid RT is not on the frame grid).

